      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'm not a doctor, but it's important to monitor your symptoms closely. Some discomfort is common after abdominal surgery, but increasing pain and fever might be a reason for concern. It would be best to check in with your surgeon or healthcare provider to ensure there are no complications from your surgery. Keep them updated on your symptoms.",
